# Project context — YourPower
- Read docs/05-architecture.md before any structural change; it is the contract.
- Stack: Flutter (Dart), custom MNA solver in pure Dart, Riverpod, drift. No backend in v1.
- lib/sim/ never imports Flutter. Never embed GPL code (no CircuitJS); ngspice is BSD.
- Every level must be validated solvable against the sim before it ships.
- Keep changes small; one task at a time; update docs when decisions change.
